  "handler_invariants": [
    "Authenticate and authorize before all tenant joins; hidden/cross-tenant IDs return NOT_FOUND.",
    "Every event in workflow page matches aggregate_type=workflow and aggregate_id=workflow_id; event_type equals summary.code.",
    "Strictly increasing aggregate_seq above request.after_seq, never above high_water; next_cursor is last returned sequence or request.after_seq if empty.",
    "run bindings and artifact links refer to the same authorized tenant and workflow or explicitly authorized shared evidence.",
    "Context fact provenance, legal source hashes, clause IDs and validation check references resolve to pinned artifacts.",
    "Readiness components appear once each; boolean summaries are derived from component checks, not user input.",
    "A verified sandbox status requires a nonnull attestation; connectivity alone is insufficient.",
    "No mutation, provider probe, review activity append or approval is performed by these GET routes."
  ]
